    print(d['umar'])
else:
    print('Umar likhi hi nahi hai')
```

in dictionary me key dhundhta hai, value nahi. get() iska chhota roop hai, par soch yahi hai.

Dhyaan se: break lagte hi loop-else NAHI chalta — agar chal raha hai to break asal me laga hi nahi hoga:

```python
