}
```

Chipka hua text padding badhane se thik ho jata hai. Border wahi rahega, andar ka text andar ki taraf hat jayega.

```css
.card {
  padding: 20px;
  border: 1px solid gray;
}
```

Margin = dabbe ke bahar ki khaali jagah (dusri cheezon se doori). Padding = dabbe ke andar ki jagah (text aur border ke beech). Background rang padding tak dikhta hai, margin par nahi.

```css
.dabba {
  margin: 20px;
  padding: 10px;
  background-color: lightblue;
}
```

Neeche wale dabbe se doori chahiye to upar wale par margin-bottom do. Dono par margin dene se kabhi-kabhi doori dugni lag sakti hai.

```css
.upar-wala {
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}
```

border ke teen hisse hote hain: motai (2px), style (solid) aur rang (black). Teeno ek line me likhte hain.

```css
.dabba {
  border: 2px solid black;
}
```

img par border lagane se photo frame jaisi dikhti hai.

```css
img {
  border: 3px solid red;
}
```

border-radius kone gol karta hai. Number jitna bada, kone utne zyada gole.

```css
.card {
  border: 1px solid gray;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
```

Gol photo ke liye width-height barabar rakho aur border-radius: 50% kar do. Photo chaukor (square) ho to sabse sahi gol banti hai.

```css
.profile {
  width: 150px;
  height: 150px;
  border-radius: 50%;
}
```

solid ki jagah dashed (line-daar) ya dotted (bindu-daar) likho — border ki style badal jayegi.

```css
