  border: 2px dashed blue;
}
```

border-bottom sirf neeche line deta hai. Heading ke neeche aisi line bahut sundar lagti hai.

```css
h2 {
  border-bottom: 3px solid orange;
  padding-bottom: 5px;
}
```

width chaudai aur height unchai set karti hai. Background dene se dabba saaf dikhega.

```css
.dabba {
  width: 400px;
  height: 200px;
  background-color: lightblue;
}
```

Sirf width doge to height anupaat ke hisab se khud set ho jati hai — photo kheenchti nahi.

```css
img {
  width: 200px;
}
```

Percent (%) wali width screen ke hisab se badalti hai — chhoti screen par dabba bhi chhota ho jata hai. Yahi responsive ki shuruaat hai.

```css
.aadha {
  width: 50%;
}
```

max-width dabbe ko seema se zyada chauda nahi hone deta. Badi screen par padhne wali site ke liye ye best hai.

```css
.page {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: auto;
}
```

vh matlab viewport (screen) ki unchai ka hissa. 100vh = poori screen jitni unchai.

```css
.pehla-hissa {
  height: 100vh;
  background-color: lightblue;
}
```

Parent dabbe par display: flex lagate hi andar ke dabbe ek line me side-by-side aa jate hain.

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
}
```

flex-direction: column se dabbe upar-se-neeche lagte hain. Default row hota hai (side-by-side).

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
```

justify-content flex ki main disha (row me dayein-baayein) me dabbo ki jagah tay karta hai.

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}
```

space-between pehle dabbe ko baayein kinare, aakhri ko daayein kinare aur baaki ko barabar faasle par rakhta hai. Menu aur logo wali line ke liye best hai.

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
```

align-items dusri disha (upar-neeche) ko sambhalta hai. Dabbe ko unchai doge tabhi beech me aana dikhega.

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  height: 200px;
}
```

gap se har do dabbo ke beech utni hi jagah aati hai — margin ginne ka jhanjhat khatam.

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  gap: 15px;
}
```

flex-wrap: wrap se jagah kam padne par dabbe agli line me chale jate hain, dabte nahi. Photo gallery ke liye kaam ka hai.

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
}
```

Jis dabbe ko flex: 1 doge, wo line ki bachi hui saari jagah le lega. Sidebar + main content wale design me ye bahut use hota hai.

```css
.bada-dabba {
  flex: 1;
}
```

grid-template-columns me jitne hisse likhoge, utne column banenge. 1fr matlab ek barabar hissa.

```css
.container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px;
}
```

Teen baar 1fr likhne se teen barabar column bante hain. Product cards ke liye ye layout sabse aam hai.

```css
.container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px;
}
```

gap row aur column dono ke beech barabar jagah deta hai.

```css
.container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}
```

Pehla column hamesha 200px rahega (jaise sidebar), dusra bachi hui jagah lega.

```css
.container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
}
```

auto-fit + minmax wali line screen ke hisab se khud column ghatati-badhati hai — badi screen par zyada photo, mobile par kam.

```css
.gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
  gap: 10px;
}
```

display: none se hissa gayab bhi ho jata hai aur uski jagah bhi khatam ho jati hai.

```css
.chhupana-hai {
  display: none;
}
```

inline-block se element line me bhi rehta hai aur usko width/margin bhi de sakte ho.

```css
button {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 5px;
}
```

position: fixed element ko screen par chipka deta hai — page scroll ho, wo wahi rahega. Dhyan rahe neeche wale content ko thoda margin-top dena pad sakta hai.

```css
header {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  background-color: white;
}
```

Pehle baap (parent) dabbe ko position: relative do. Phir andar ke label ko absolute doge to wo is dabbe ke hisab se kone par lagega:

```css
.photo-dabba {
  position: relative;
}

.naya-label {
  position: absolute;
  top: 5px;
  right: 5px;
  background-color: red;
  color: white;
  padding: 2px 6px;
}
```

sticky apni jagah par rehta hai, par scroll par nirdharit jagah (top) par chipak jata hai. Fixed se farak — ye apne hisse ke andar hi rehta hai.

```css
.side-menu {
  position: sticky;
  top: 10px;
}
```

z-index jitna bada, dabba utna upar dikhega. Ye sirf un elements par kaam karta hai jinpar position lagi ho.

```css
.upar-wala {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 10;
}
```

selector ke baad :hover lagane se wo style sirf tab lagta hai jab mouse us par ho. Button ke liye background gehra karna aam hai.

```css
button:hover {
  background-color: darkgreen;
}
```

Hover par rang badalne se user ko pata chalta hai ki ye click ho sakta hai.

```css
a:hover {
  color: orange;
}
```

transform: scale(1.1) photo ko 10% bada kar deta hai. Gallery me ye asar bahut achha lagta hai.

```css
img:hover {
  transform: scale(1.1);
}
```

Hover par shadow gehri karne se card utha hua lagta hai — user ko lagta hai ye dab sakta hai.

```css
.card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 8px 16px gray;
}
```

nav a ka matlab — nav ke andar ke links. Hover par halka background menu ko jeevant banata hai.

```css
nav a:hover {
  background-color: lightgray;
  padding: 5px;
}
```

transition badlav ko nirdharit samay (0.3 second) me dheere-dheere karta hai. Bina iske rang ekdum se badalta hai.

```css
button {
  background-color: green;
  color: white;
  transition: background-color 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
  background-color: darkgreen;
}
```

Pehle @keyframes me animation ke steps likhte hain, phir element par animation naam aur samay ke saath lagate hain:

```css
.chakkar {
  width: 60px;
  height: 60px;
  background-color: orange;
  animation: ghumna 2s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes ghumna {
  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
```

@keyframes me opacity 0 (gayab) se 1 (pura dikhai) tak le jao — text halke se ubharta dikhega:

```css
.swagat {
  animation: dikhai 2s;
}

@keyframes dikhai {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}
```

translateX se dabba jagah badalta hai. -50px matlab 50px baayein se shuru hokar apni jagah aayega:

```css
.aata-hua {
  animation: khisakna 1s;
}

@keyframes khisakna {
  from { transform: translateX(-50px); opacity: 0; }
  to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
}
```

scale ko 1 se 1.1 aur wapas 1 par le jane se button dhadakta hua lagta hai. Offer wale button par dhyan kheenchta hai:

```css
.offer-button {
  animation: dhadak 1s infinite;
}

@keyframes dhadak {
  0% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.1); }
  100% { transform: scale(1); }
}
```

animation-play-state: paused se chalti animation ruk jati hai. Hover par lagane se mouse aate hi ghumna band:

```css
.ghumta {
  animation: ghumna 3s linear infinite;
}

.ghumta:hover {
  animation-play-state: paused;
}

@keyframes ghumna {
  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
```

Aakhri wala number batata hai kitni baar animation chalegi. infinite ki jagah 3 likh do — teen baar ghumkar ruk jayega:

```css
.dabba {
  animation: ghumna 2s linear 3;
}

@keyframes ghumna {
  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
```

Media query ka matlab: jab screen 600px ya usse chhoti ho, tab andar wale niyam lagu karo. Badi screen par heading apne aap badi rahegi.

```css
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  h1 {
    font-size: 22px;
  }
}
```

Chhoti screen par side-by-side dabbe dab jate hain. Media query me flex-direction: column karne se wo ek ke neeche ek aa jate hain.

```css
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .container {
    flex-direction: column;
  }
}
```

768px aam taur par tablet ki chaudai mani jati hai. Usse chhoti screen par card poori chaudai lega.

```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .card {
    width: 100%;
  }
}
```

max-width: 100% photo ko dabbe se bada nahi hone deta aur height: auto anupaat sahi rakhta hai. Ye do line har site me honi chahiye.

```css
img {
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}
```

display: block karne se har link nayi line me aata hai — ungli se dabana aasan ho jata hai.

```css
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  nav a {
    display: block;
    margin: 5px 0;
  }
}
```

max-width + margin: auto ka combo hi aam responsive design ki neev hai. Badi screen par content beech me rehta hai, chhoti par khud ghata jata hai.

```css
.page {
  max-width: 1000px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 10px;
}
```

box-shadow ke hisse: dayein doori, neeche doori, dhundhlapan, rang. Isse card page se utha hua lagta hai.

```css
.card {
  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px gray;
  padding: 15px;
}
```

opacity 1 matlab pura saaf dikhai, 0 matlab bilkul gayab. 0.6 beech ka halka asar hai.

```css
.halka {
  opacity: 0.6;
}
```

cursor: pointer se mouse ka teer ungli me badal jata hai — user samajh jata hai ki ye dab sakta hai.

```css
