* ka matlab hai har element. margin-padding zero se shuruaat karna aur box-sizing lagana aaj kal har site ki pehli teen line hoti hain.

```css
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
```

Iske bina padding dabbe ki chaudai me jud jati hai (200 + 40 = 240 ho jayegi). border-box lagane se kul chaudai 200 hi rehti hai, padding andar sama jati hai.

```css
