let dusra = "Kumar";
console.log(pehla + " " + dusra);
```

let wale variable ki value nayi line me aaram se badal sakte ho. Dhyaan do — dusri baar let nahi likhte, sirf naam.

```javascript
let score = 50;
score = 80;
console.log(score);
```

Boolean me sirf do value hoti hain: true ya false. Quotes nahi lagte — ye shabd nahi, halat (state) hai.

```javascript
