message = "Namaste!";
console.log(message);
```

Do number ke beech + lagane se jod hota hai. Jawab 35 aayega.

```javascript
let a = 10;
let b = 25;
console.log(a + b);
```

Minus ke liye - chinh use hota hai. Jawab 325 — bacha hua paisa.

```javascript
let kul = 500;
let kharcha = 175;
console.log(kul - kharcha);
```

Guna ke liye * aur bhaag ke liye / chinh hota hai. Jawab 60 aur 3 aayega.

```javascript
let a = 12;
console.log(a * 5);
console.log(a / 4);
```

% chinh remainder deta hai. 17 ko 2 se bhaag dene par 1 bachega — isiliye 17 odd hai. Even-odd jaanch me yahi trick lagti hai.

```javascript
