Dono tareeke chalte hain: n * n ya n ** 2. Jawab 81 aayega.

```javascript
let n = 9;
console.log(n * n);
console.log(n ** 2);
```

Formula hai (mool * dar * samay) / 100. Jawab 1000 aayega. Console me naam ke saath value aise dikhate hain.

```javascript
