let byaj = (p * r * t) / 100;
console.log("Byaj:", byaj);
```

Pehle teeno ko jodo, phir 3 se bhaag do. Koshtho (bracket) zaroori hain, warna bhaag pehle ho jayega. Jawab 80.

```javascript
let a = 70, b = 80, c = 90;
let avg = (a + b + c) / 3;
console.log(avg);
```

Mile hue ko kul se bhaag karke 100 se guna kar do. Jawab 84% aayega.

```javascript
