localStorage browser me chhoti jaankari surakshit rakhta hai. Page khulte hi pehle jaancho ki pichli pasand kya thi — wahi mode lag jayega. (Upar wali .dark CSS class iske saath chahiye.)

```html
<button onclick="mode()">Dark/Light</button>
<script>
function mode() {
  document.body.classList.toggle("dark");
  let m = document.body.classList.contains("dark") ? "dark" : "light";
  localStorage.setItem("mode", m);
}
if (localStorage.getItem("mode") === "dark") {
  document.body.classList.add("dark");
}
</script>
```

